tr><td align="right"><italic>C.ele</italic></td><td align="center">5070</td><td align="center">4174</td><td align="center">21925</td><td align="left">490</td></tr><tr><td align="right"><italic>S.cer</italic></td><td align="center">2470</td><td align="center">2451</td><td align="center">6630</td><td align="left">428</td></tr><tr><td align="right"><italic>A.thal</italic></td><td align="center">4346</td><td align="center">1893</td><td align="center">9169</td><td align="left">405</td></tr><tr><td align="right"><italic>H.pyl</italic></td><td align="center">325</td><td align="center">324</td><td align="center">1590</td><td align="left">105</td></tr><tr><td align="right">Ecdy</td><td align="center">-</td><td align="center">-</td><td align="center">3024</td><td align="left">235</td></tr><tr><td align="right">Anim</td><td align="center">-</td><td align="center">-</td><td align="center">6847</td><td align="left">406</td></tr><tr><td align="right">Opis</td><td align="center">-</td><td align="center">-</td><td align="center">2451</td><td align="left">199</td></tr><tr><td align="right">Euk</td><td align="center">-</td><td align="center">-</td><td align="center">1893</td><td align="left">130</td></tr><tr><td align="right">Cell</td><td align="center">-</td><td align="center">-</td><td align="center">324</td><td align="left">33</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p><sup>a</sup>Number of genes with BTPs to a human gene.</p><p><sup>b</sup>Number of genes that have BTPs and have expression data.</p><p><sup>c</sup>Total number of genes with available expression data.</p><p><sup>d</sup>Total number of pathways with at least five genes.</p><p><sup>e</sup>Number of human genes with protein sequences available for constructing the BTP table.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></sec></back></article>